WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.082
How often does your team stop to hunt for
an answer?

2
00:00:03.232 --> 00:00:06.802
It's usually in someone's head, or a file
nobody can find.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.876
We build a brain that knows your business,

4
00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:13.464
and agents that use it to get real work
done.

5
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.153
First, we connect the tools you already
use.

6
00:00:19.303 --> 00:00:21.551
Nobody sees anything they can't see today.

7
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.518
Then your team just asks.

8
00:00:26.668 --> 00:00:30.867
Every answer points to its source, and
when the brain doesn't know, it says so.

9
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.996
Agents take it further.

10
00:00:35.146 --> 00:00:39.470
They read the request, check the brain,
and do the work right inside your tools.

11
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.940
Anything sensitive waits for a person.

12
00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:48.508
One click to approve, and every step is
logged for review.

13
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.226
We start with one process.

14
00:00:53.376 --> 00:00:56.780
Your first agent is usually live in three
to five weeks.

15
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.446
Tell us one process, and we'll sketch the
agent.

16
00:01:01.596 --> 00:01:02.432
Book a call.

